<% content_for :title, "Self-hosted product feedback" %>

<section class="public-page py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="max-w-3xl">
    <p class="public-eyebrow">Open source · self-hosted</p>
    <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.045em] text-base-content sm:text-6xl sm:leading-[1.05]">
      Feedback that stays close to your product.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-base-content/65">
      Ideabug brings announcements, bug reports, feature voting, and a public roadmap into one small embeddable widget.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
      <%= link_to "Explore the roadmap", "/roadmap", class: "btn btn-primary" %>
      <a href="https://github.com/humadroid-io/ideabug" class="btn btn-ghost border border-base-300">
        View on GitHub
        <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <dl class="mt-16 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-300 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="bg-base-100 p-5">
        <dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-base-content/45">One widget</dt>
        <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-base-content/70">A single embed for updates and feedback.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-base-100 p-5">
        <dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-base-content/45">Your data</dt>
        <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-base-content/70">Run it on infrastructure you control.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-base-100 p-5">
        <dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-base-content/45">Real context</dt>
        <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-base-content/70">Keep product conversations in the product.</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="border-y border-base-300 bg-base-200/45">
  <div class="public-page py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <p class="public-eyebrow">A focused toolkit</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-base-content sm:text-3xl">
          Listen, decide, and close the loop.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-base-content/60">
          No engagement dashboard theatre. Just the surfaces a small product team needs to communicate and prioritize.
        </p>
      </div>

      <dl class="grid gap-x-10 gap-y-8 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="border-l border-base-300 pl-5">
          <dt class="font-medium text-base-content">Announcements</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-base-content/60">Ship targeted product updates directly inside the host app.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l border-base-300 pl-5">
          <dt class="font-medium text-base-content">Bug reports</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-base-content/60">Capture useful page and browser context with every report.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l border-base-300 pl-5">
          <dt class="font-medium text-base-content">Feature voting</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-base-content/60">Let customers propose ideas and show where demand is real.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l border-base-300 pl-5">
          <dt class="font-medium text-base-content">Public roadmap</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-base-content/60">Share what is now, next, and shipped without another tool.</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="public-page py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="grid items-start gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
    <div>
      <p class="public-eyebrow">Small footprint</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-base-content sm:text-3xl">
        Add it with two lines of HTML.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-base-content/60">
        Anonymous visitors work out of the box. Pass a signed JWT when you want identified contacts, segments, and durable read state.
      </p>
    </div>

    <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-neutral p-5 text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-content shadow-sm"><code>&lt;div id="feedback"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script src="<%= request.base_url %>/script.js"
        data-ideabug-host="<%= request.base_url %>"
        data-ideabug-target="#feedback"
        defer&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</code></pre>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="border-t border-base-300">
  <div class="public-page flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-6 py-12 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-base-content">Ready to bring feedback in-house?</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/60">Read the setup guide or look through the live roadmap.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="https://github.com/humadroid-io/ideabug" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Read the docs</a>
      <%= link_to "Live roadmap", "/roadmap", class: "btn btn-ghost btn-sm" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
